{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sophie-allport-doorstops-and-draught-excluders-2608-0008","content_id":"3c53a4f1-92ab-4c02-86a7-4ad3fe4402f9","description":"Product Recall for Sophie Allport Doorstops and Draught Excluders presenting a risk to health. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"5a602d68-5422-4b82-9271-01a619da5ac6","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-07T09:35:33+01:00","id":"5a602d68-5422-4b82-9271-01a619da5ac6","title":"Link to Product Images and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-07T09:35:33+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9e77559a177a1decf97e8e/2608-0008-product-recall-sophie-allport-draught-excluders-and-doorstops.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Sophie Allport Doorstops and Draught Excluders</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk to health as the marble chips sealed inside the doorstop/excluder may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Sophie Allport and John Lewis.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Ornaments (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Sophie Allport</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period (John Lewis)</td>\n      <td>01/09/2014 – 31/12/2019</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>India</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Range of novelty doorstops and draught excluders sold from September 2014. For a full list of product names and codes, please see below.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_5a602d68-5422-4b82-9271-01a619da5ac6\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9e77559a177a1decf97e8e/2608-0008-product-recall-sophie-allport-draught-excluders-and-doorstops.pdf\">Link to Product Images and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"sophie-allport-products-and-product-identifiers\">Sophie Allport Products and Product Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Code</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Hare</td>\n      <td>ALL25630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Beehive</td>\n      <td>ALL36630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - NT - Woodland - Owl</td>\n      <td>ALL52630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Chicken</td>\n      <td>ALL8630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Pheasant</td>\n      <td>ALL19630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Sheep</td>\n      <td>ALL43630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - ZSL - Elephant</td>\n      <td>ALL54630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Runner Duck</td>\n      <td>ALL35630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Dachshund</td>\n      <td>ALL46630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Cat (Purrfect)</td>\n      <td>ALL31630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Space Ship</td>\n      <td>ALL62630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Bubbles &amp; Fizz</td>\n      <td>ALL61630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Terrier</td>\n      <td>ALL15630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Labrador</td>\n      <td>ALL12630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Safari - Elephant</td>\n      <td>ALL33630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Cows</td>\n      <td>ALL40630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Doorstop - Rugby Ball</td>\n      <td>ALL26630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Shaped - Woof</td>\n      <td>ALL32636</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Shaped - Dachshund</td>\n      <td>ALL46636</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Shaped - Purrfect</td>\n      <td>ALL31636</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Pheasant</td>\n      <td>ALL19635</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Highland Stag</td>\n      <td>ALL29635</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Chicken</td>\n      <td>ALL8635</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Draught Excluder - Woof</td>\n      <td>ALL32635</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"john-lewis-products-and-product-identifiers\">John Lewis Products and Product Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Code</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hare Doorstop</td>\n      <td>57092404</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pheasant Doorstop</td>\n      <td>57092402</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Runner Duck Doorstop</td>\n      <td>57092401</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Cat (Purrfect) Doorstop</td>\n      <td>57092403</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Beehive Doorstop</td>\n      <td>77200666</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Chicken Doorstop</td>\n      <td>77200629</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sheep Doorstop</td>\n      <td>77200703</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Terrier Doorstop</td>\n      <td>77200630</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Cows Doorstop</td>\n      <td>77200702</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rugby Ball Doorstop</td>\n      <td>77200687</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk to health as the marble chips sealed inside the doorstop/excluder may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.</p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Sophie Allport and John Lewis. We recommend that you stop using the products immediately and keep them out of reach of children. Follow the instructions below for details on disposal and return of the product.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, please access:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Sophie Allport: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.sophieallport.com/pages/product-recall\">https://www.sophieallport.com/pages/product-recall</a>, or contact 01778 560256</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>John Lewis: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.johnlewis.com/customer-services/shopping-with-us/product-recalls\">https://www.johnlewis.com/customer-services/shopping-with-us/product-recalls</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.</li>\n  <li>If the product is undamaged, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.</li>\n  <li>If the product is damaged and the filling is accessible, clean-up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the filling and product along with the used gloves, mask and cloths. Keep children and other people away from areas where the marble chips have been used until the area has been cleaned.</li>\n  <li>Double bag the product, gloves, mask and cloth and double tape it securely.</li>\n  <li>If purchased at Sophie Allport, return the product to one of the three Sophie Allport shops (<a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.sophieallport.com/pages/our-shops\">www.sophieallport.com/pages/our-shops</a>) for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If purchased elsewhere, return the product to store where specified by the retailer for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to the retailer, or the product was purchased via an online marketplace, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, or questions, contact the retailers directly or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">GOV.UK page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2608-0008</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Addition of John Lewis recall information. ","public_timestamp":"2026-09-07T08:36:05Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-13T10:55:33Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"sophie-allport-products-and-product-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Sophie Allport Products and Product Identifiers"},{"id":"john-lewis-products-and-product-identifiers","level":3,"text":"John Lewis Products and Product Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-13","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-13T11: